# 🚀 SOCRATIC ANCHOR: PROJECT OVERVIEW

## 📌 QUICK REFERENCE

**Mission**: Transform burnt-out creatives from AI-slop consumers to focused, proud creators via strict 7-screen Socratic workflow.

**Outcome**: One evening → clear identity + one committed project + 30-60min next step (user's own words).

**Core Constraint**: NO content generation. NO back buttons. NO shortcuts.

## 🧠 FIRST PRINCIPLES (Elon/Musk)

**Core Truth**: People don't feel proud of work they didn't do. Delegated creativity = hollow output.

**5 Axioms**:

1. No content generation ever
2. Ownership starts high (user before AI)
3. Decision = commitment (Pursue/Park/Kill)
4. Identity > tasks
5. Friction = feature

